<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian July wholesale prices up 0.4 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Austrian July wholesale prices up 0.4 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN INFLATION	    JULY	  JUNE	  JULY 96</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index rise	-0.1	  0.1	    -0.2</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation	     0.4	  0.1	    -0.1</p>
<p> Index (base 1986)	    100.4	100.5	   104.1</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
